    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardWelcomeHelp">This assistant prepares a simple starting configuration. You can fine-tune everything later in settings.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="LOCCSM_SetupWizardWelcomeBody">Controller Manager tracks the controllers you use in a game session, warns you on disconnects, and can temporarily stop the game so you do not lose progress.</sys:String>
